sound MY0.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text The people my father used to do theater with are starting a small acting troupe, and seem to be planning a kickoff performance.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh... Well, that sounds nice.
sound MY1.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay...
text This must be worrying Nagisa.
text She has to be thinking that he would be a part of the group if only she hadn't made him give up on that dream.
sound MY2.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text My dad even got an invitation to the performance too.
sound MY3.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text He must want to go.
text @[Tomoya]
text Probably. It's a production by his old friends, after all.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG16B"
