text What's he saying that for? He's found half-days to take off plenty of times before.
sound MY5.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text No, it's not a half-day trip. The performance is in Kyushu, actually.
text @[Tomoya]
text Gah... Now that's far...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG18B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
