text @[Nagisa]
text I know my father often leaves the store to go play, but  he still takes the time to properly bake the bread every morning.
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh... So then his only option would be to close for those two days.
sound MY8.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I think he's saying that he won't go because he doesn't want to neglect his job like that.
sound MY9.aac
