text A friend from work...
text From before, or someone new?
text If he's from his old job, then I can trust him.
text As far as I know, there weren't any bad people there.
text He'd drink with his friends while talking about the adventures they went on back when they were young and energetic.
text But if he's from my father's new job, there's no way I'd ever trust him.
text There's no way my father would be able to distinguish between a good person and a bad person in the state he's in now.
text I'm sure he'd just go along with anyone who came to him talking about a good way to make some money.
text @[Tomoya]
text What kind of work?
